# train.csv / test.csv / label_map.json are intentionally tracked in git
# (Phase 2 change) -- dvc.yaml's `prepare` stage outputs use `cache: false`
# now, same reasoning as models/.gitignore: no DVC remote is configured, so
# a fresh clone (CI, monitoring workflows) had no way to get these
# otherwise. dvc.lock still pins their hashes for reproducibility. See
# docs/deployment.md.
